+  // [cod3 0323] A read at `now_ns` where the pad itself shows the press: its window starts here if no read has shown
+  // it yet, and it is let go once the window has passed (the pad shows it as long as it is held).
+  static void Seen(Entry& e, uint64_t now_ns) {
